    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d500">

                <pb facs="0527" n="493" xml:id="pg493"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-06-14"><hi rendition="#italic">June 14,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Saturday minister for foreign affairs promised me unofficially, in personal
                    interview, favorable result in Hernsheim case in a few days. Doing all
                    possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
